28245      * Request a Spline Transformation of Equivalence Ratio;
28246      proc transreg data=Gas solve ss2 plots=(transformation obp residuals);
28247      model identity(nox) = spline(EqRatio / nknots=4);
28248      run;

NOTE: 2 observations were deleted from the analysis due to missing values.

